<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21308" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βῶλος</span></b> , ἡ, less freq.
			ὁ (v. sub fin.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lump, clod of earth</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴκοι δ᾽ ὑπὸ βῶλος ἀρότρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					18.374
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγρᾶς ἀρούρας β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1286
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς βαλῶ ταύτῃ τῇ βώλῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.3.27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ἀνιστάναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Rom.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βῶλος ἄρουραν</span>, prov.
			'carrying coals to Newcastle', <i><span class="en">
				Zen.
				2.74
			</span></i>; esp. of <i>earth</i> fraudulently mixed with corn, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				708.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄβωλος</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			in Poets, <i>land, soil</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαθεῖαν β. ἀροῦντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					4.37
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.561
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λίβυσσα κρύψει β.
				Ἀννίβου δέμας</span> Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Flam.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				3.125b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> generally,
				<i>lump</i>, as of gold, <i>nugget</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				833b11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.2.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσέα βῶλος</span>, of the sun,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				783
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Or.</u>
				984
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. μολίβδου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωλίτης</span>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				526
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπαργάνιον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.21
			</span></i> (v. l.). (Fem. acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Moer.
				95
			</span></i>; masc. in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				40.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHolm.</u>
				2.31
			</span></i>, etc.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
